ull,"archived_by":null},{"id":1332303119,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxMzMyMzAzMTE5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/regression","name":"regression","color":"ff63ac","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/25","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25/labels","id":15520464,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4A7NLQ","number":25,"title":"4.8","description":"","creator":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":345,"closed_issues":2335,"state":"open","created_at":"2026-04-13T15:59:35Z","updated_at":"2026-10-22T08:15:08Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":null},"comments":2,"created_at":"2026-08-31T04:10:12Z","updated_at":"2026-08-31T19:55:08Z","closed_at":"2026-08-31T19:55:08Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\nReproducible in 4.8dev1 - 4.8dev4\nNot reproducible in 4.7 - 4.7.2\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.8.dev4 - Windows 11 - OpenGL 3 (Compatibility)\n\n### Issue description\n\nWhen a project in 4.8.dev1 through dev4 is exported for HTML5 (or even when just using the \"Run in browser\" button in the editor), materials that use normal map textures compressed with Basis Universal don't render correctly. I don't know exactly what it is, but depending on the lighting, it almost seems like the map is inverted or something similar.\n\nI tested this with three GPUs on Windows (RTX 5070 Ti, GTX 1660 Ti, UHD 770) and one on Ubuntu 24.04 (Intel HD Graphics 500), and so far it only seems to happen on Windows (both Firefox and Chrome). The 5070 Ti and the UHD 770 were with Windows 11, and the 1660 Ti was Windows 10. I'll test it with more systems when I can.\n\nThe first image below is what it looks like in the editor (and what it looks like in the browser when exported with 4.7-4.7.2). The second image is what it looks like in the browser when exported with any of the current 4.8 dev releases.\n\n<img width=\"639\" height=\"487\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/2c3ffd5c-9b68-4a07-b273-2c250cf6b5ae\" />\n\n<img width=\"639\" height=\"487\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/b487da16-5814-47aa-80d8-0f903396098b\" />\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n1. Create a project, set the rendering method to compatibility. (Remember to download the HTML5 export templates.)\n2. Create a material that uses a normal map image with the compression mode set to \"Basis Universal\".\n3. Place it on a mesh in the scene (can be a CSG mesh or MeshInstance3D).\n4. In the editor's 3D preview, the material looks fine, but it doesn't render correctly when launching the game in a web browser.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nThe two textures included in the MRP are from Poly Haven and are public domain (CC0)\nhttps://polyhaven.com/a/large_square_pattern_01\n\n[godot-4-8-normals-bug.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/31627495/godot-4-8-normals-bug.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123017/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":1},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123017/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}